   334	    """
   335	    Apply a physically-consistent yaw rotation to a single sample's metadata.
   336	
   337	    The equirectangular depth map is rolled horizontally by the integer number of
   338	    columns closest to ``alpha_rad`` and its stored per-pixel 3D vectors are rotated
   339	    about z. All pose vectors are rotated about z by the same effective angle.
   340	    ``context_audio``, ``scene`` and any other field pass through unchanged. The
   341	    rotation is exact (no interpolation) because the column shift is quantised and
   342	    the rotation matrix uses the matching effective angle.
