   527	    :func:`invariant_conditioning` runs (``GeometryConditioner`` reads only its
   528	    own ``*_vit`` pose and ``depth``, neither of which the cylindrical step
   529	    touched, and the extra dist-embedder orbit calls consume no RNG), which is
   530	    pinned numerically by ``src/tests/test_fa_cartesian.py``.
   531	
   532	    Two contracts are FAIL-CLOSED, and both are deliberately STRICTER than
   533	    :func:`invariant_conditioning`, which short-circuits to the base pass when the
   534	    orbit ids or ``depth`` are absent:
