   536	    * every id in :data:`POSE_KEYS` must be present in the conditioner's output.
   537	      Averaging whichever subset happened to exist would ship an arm whose
   538	      treatment differs from the declared one, invisibly.
   539	    * every sample must carry ``depth``, and all samples must agree on the
   540	      panorama width. The orbit rotates depth and poses together, so a missing
